<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.840"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">Dearest, darling, my universe</text><text for="L2">Would you take me away?</text><text for="L3">To a distant place where my fragile imagination</text><text for="L4">Could never reach</text><text for="L5">Somewhere far, from Earth to Mars</text><text for="L6">Would you come with me?</text><text for="L7">Wherever that may be</text><text for="L8">Endless solitude</text><text for="L9">Searching for its antonym</text><text for="L10">What kind of mistake</text><text for="L11">Brought the two of us here</text><text for="L12">Together?</text><text for="L13">Far from the world around us, let's run on</text><text for="L14">Let's run towards the very edge, my lover</text><text for="L15">Could this be a bad ending?</text><text for="L16">Two lost souls wandering, um</text><text for="L17">Hold me tight until I shatter</text><text for="L18">Kiss me full of love, my lover</text><text for="L19">Love is all, love is all</text><text for="L20">Love, love, love, love</text><text for="L21">Yet still, in the end</text><text for="L22">Why is it that</text><text for="L23">We can only be each other's?</text><text for="L24">Far from the world around us, let's run on</text><text for="L25">Let's run towards the very edge, my lover</text><text for="L26">Could this be a bad ending?</text><text for="L27">Two lost souls wandering, um</text><text for="L28">I slowly take you in my eyes</text><text for="L29">Give me a gentle smile, just once more</text><text for="L30">Like that night when we floated</text><text for="L31">Weightless, unafraid</text><text for="L32">Would you fall with me</text><text for="L33">Without any fear?</text><text for="L34">Break me apart, destroy me deeper, my ruiner</text><text for="L35">I want to drown in sorrow with you, my lover</text><text for="L36">Far from the fate that chases us, let's run on</text><text for="L37">Let's run towards the very edge, my lover</text><text for="L38">Two of us, lost together</text><text for="L39">By choice</text><text for="L40">Hold me tight until I shatter</text><text for="L41">Kiss me full of love, my lover</text><text for="L42">Our love wins all, love wins all</text><text for="L43">Love, love, love, love</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>IU</songwriter><songwriter>Lee Ji Eun</songwriter><songwriter>Seo Donghwan</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration automaticallyCreated="true" xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="23.342" end="23.761" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">Dear</span><span begin="23.761" end="24.209" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">e</span><span begin="24.209" end="24.537" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">st,</span> <span begin="24.537" end="24.836" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">dar</span><span begin="24.836" end="25.428" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ling,</span> <span begin="25.428" end="25.684" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">my</span> <span begin="25.684" end="26.527" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">u</span><span begin="26.527" end="26.889" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ni</span><span begin="26.889" end="27.419" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ver</span><span begin="27.419" end="27.697" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">se</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="27.950" end="28.955" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nal</span>  <span begin="29.190" end="29.528" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span> <span begin="29.528" end="29.911" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ryeo</span> <span begin="29.911" end="30.192" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ga</span>  <span begin="30